  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e858b2bad157b4996950d1245fad0c9f, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n: t\xECm m\u1EB7t t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng ti\u1EBFp
    theo sau khi cam \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ED5i \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\u1ED1i; c\xF9ng
    ti\u1EBFp x\xFAc v\xE0 chu k\u1EF3 h\u1ED3i \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc. B\u1ED1 tr\xED:
    P22 + P07 \u2014 hai khoang d\u1EABn t\u1EDBi hai ph\xEDa ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn
    c\u1EE7a c\xF9ng c\u1EE5m c\u01A1 c\u1EA5u; chu\u1ED7i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA9y
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ED1 tr\xED theo tuy\u1EBFn.\nRecovery: M\u1ED7i khoang
    c\xF3 s\xE2n xoay r\u1ED9ng; rack kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \u0111\xE1y ng\xF5
    c\u1EE5t, bi lu\xF4n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\u1EDDi m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA9y \u0111\u1EC3
    h\u1ED3i l\xF2 xo"
